364
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:20,960
[SPEAKER_00] Pa kreće onda.

365
00:28:21,279 --> 00:28:25,279
[SPEAKER_01] Pa kreće se, znači to mi je isto bilo šokantno, kad ideš van, ono kreće se u osam.

366
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:25,920
[SPEAKER_00] Pa kao.

367
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,920
[SPEAKER_00] Pa ovo utopija za nas starije.

368
00:28:28,240 --> 00:28:28,960
