375
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:48,400
[SPEAKER_01] Tako da.

376
00:29:49,839 --> 00:29:53,440
[SPEAKER_01] To mi je bilo tamanji 670 eura da pokrijem taj dom.

377
00:29:53,680 --> 00:29:54,960
