391
00:30:38,799 --> 00:30:39,599
[SPEAKER_00] To je bilo target.

392
00:30:40,799 --> 00:30:42,079
[SPEAKER_01] To je američka kultura.

393
00:30:42,960 --> 00:30:44,799
[SPEAKER_00] Sigledano je bacio one pakete.

394
00:30:45,039 --> 00:30:49,680
[SPEAKER_01] Da, da, ušli u Walmart i onda imaš samo jedan izlaz gdje su ti ono kao super sized, jako male.

395
00:30:49,839 --> 00:30:51,599
